      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i already tried stuff. i went to a few meetups but it's not the same. it's just... exhausting. like everyone has their people and their lives and im just an extra in the background of everyone else's movie. i feel like if i just stopped showing up, nobody would even realize i was gone. it wouldnt even change anything for anyone.",
